"collection.mechanism.star.name":"星标块、星门","collection.mechanism.star.effect":"星标块只能通过同色星门；普通块也可使用同色星门。星块离场后星门仍保留。","collection.mechanism.flip-door.name":"翻转门","collection.mechanism.flip-door.effect":"每次整块消除或剥层的离场动画结束后，所有翻转门切换开关一次，包含本次使用的门；普通移动不触发。","collection.mechanism.colored-grid.name":"彩色地格","collection.mechanism.colored-grid.effect":"只有当前外层同色的块可进入，不自动消除或变色。有彩色地格的关卡不含外壳块。","collection.mechanism.bomb.name":"炸弹","collection.mechanism.bomb.effect":"色块可操作后才开始倒计时；暂停时不计时，到0则失败。移除色块或剥掉炸弹所在外壳可解除。","collection.mechanism.shutter.name":"卷帘门","collection.mechanism.shutter.effect":"遮挡区内色块不可见、不可移动。每次整块消除或剥层减1，归零后揭开整组色块。","collection.mechanism.layered-lift.name":"升降台","collection.mechanism.layered-lift.effect":"固定区域全部腾空后揭露下一层；任何色块占用一部分都会阻挡，移出即可，不必消除。","collection.mechanism.color-exit.name":"普通出口","collection.mechanism.color-exit.effect":"匹配色块当前外层颜色；完整横截面须由同一门口覆盖，宽块不能以细柄穿过窄门。","collection.mechanism.irregular-block.name":"异形色块","collection.mechanism.irregular-block.effect":"保持整个形状上下左右平移，不能旋转或拆分；碰撞按实际占格判断。","collection.mechanism.irregular-board.name":"异形棋盘","collection.mechanism.irregular-board.effect":"所有色块占格都必须位于可玩区域，不能穿越缺口或棋盘分隔缝。","collection.mechanism.frozen-exit.name":"冰冻出口","collection.mechanism.frozen-exit.effect":"冰数归零前不能通行；每次整块消除或剥层，使冰冻出口计数减1。","collection.mechanism.numeric-ice.name":"数字冰块","collection.mechanism.numeric-ice.effect":"冰数大于0时不能移动或消除；显示后，其他块整块消除或剥层使其减1，隐藏期间不减数。","collection.mechanism.multilayer-shell.name":"外壳块","collection.mechanism.multilayer-shell.effect":"最多外壳与本体两层且异色；剥层后位置、形状不变，改为本体颜色。剥层也算一次清除。","collection.mechanism.timed-generator.name":"定时生成器","collection.mechanism.timed-generator.effect":Il["feature.description.timed-generator"],"collection.mechanism.staged-frame.name":"阶段框","collection.mechanism.staged-frame.effect":Il["feature.description.staged-frame"],"gameplay.tutorial.dragToExit":"跟随手势，将方块送出同色出口","gameplay.blocked.inactive":"暂时不能移动","gameplay.blocked.notAtEdge":"先对准出口","gameplay.blocked.pathBlocked":"出口路径被挡住","gameplay.blocked.noGate":"这里没有出口"